WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 line:0% align:end size:15%
<ruby><rt>kaa.lt</rt></ruby>

1
00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:34.010
Two more minutes!

2
00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:35.770
My second sword!

3
00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:38.890
Demon-Dweller!

4
00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:54.280
Demon-Destroyer!

5
00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:00.010
What is this creature?

6
00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:05.390
I was the weakest on the first 
level of the underworld.

7
00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:09.260
I never could've stood a chance 
against these supreme devils.

8
00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:13.290
Live, Liebe...

9
00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:17.140
My beloved son.

10
00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:20.890
The reason I've been able to fight 
up until now is all thanks to you!

11
00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:23.400
So seriously, thank you so much!

12
00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:27.020
That's my line, dumbass.

13
00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:29.800
Thanks to you, I get to fight these guys!

14
00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:33.200
What is this creature?

15
00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:35.910
There shouldn't be a creature alive

16
00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:39.910
that can attack me or
withstand my attacks!

17
00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:45.180
All living things should only 
exist as my playthings...

18
00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:47.070
And yet...

19
00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:51.670
I can't enjoy them anymore.

20
00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:54.570
What the hell are you?!

21
00:01:57.560 --> 00:02:00.430
What is this emotion?!

22
00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:04.440
You don't need to know. 
You don't need to remember it.

23
00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:08.570
You're the supreme devils of 
the first level of the underworld.

24
00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:11.910
There was nothing that 
could ever threaten you,

25
00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:14.200
so of course you wouldn't know!

26
00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.530
But that's called fear!

27
00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:25.060
Come back here, you jerk!

28
00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:30.050
It appears as though he won't be able 
to stay in that form for much longer.

29
00:02:30.050 --> 00:02:32.550
As long as I can escape 
until then, I can win!

30
00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:34.300
Damn it, they're fast!

31
00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:36.640
Crap... I can't catch up to them!

32
00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:42.710
I promise that I'll grind 
you up into a bloody pulp!

33
00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:47.150
As well as your little friends! 
And all the humans in this world!

34
00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:49.480
I won't let that happen.

35
00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:52.940
I can at least hold you for a second!

36
00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:57.500
How ironic, supreme devil.

37
00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:00.660
You have an unfathomable amount of 
mana, and the ones you fear are...

38
00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:08.630
Hands off

39
00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:11.810
this world!

40
00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:26.190
...a human and devil with 
absolutely no magic.

41
00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:52.960
The Highest vs. The Lowest

42
00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:56.970
The Devil Union...

43
00:03:57.470 --> 00:04:00.470
It's clear you haven't fully completed it.

44
00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:03.470
But well done, you idiot.

45
00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:09.540
You really are like Captain 
Yami, Vice Captain Nacht!

46
00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.980
Who's like who, now?

47
00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:16.110
What was that for?!

48
00:04:18.810 --> 00:04:23.420
When I see him, 
I'm reminded of my old self.

49
00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:27.000
Ow, ow, ow! Not again!

50
00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:29.800
The insane full-body pain that 
comes after the Devil Union!

51
00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:33.790
I won't be able to use it again for thirty
minutes! Or go into Black Mode, either!

52
00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:37.050
Oh, God, it hurts!

53
00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:37.050
Thirty minutes, huh?

54
00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:42.270
The Dark Triad has now gained 
powers from supreme devils.

55
00:04:42.270 --> 00:04:45.060
It'll be rough lasting 
through thirty minutes.

56
00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:49.050
Morris opening the underworld gates 
faster is also a problem, but...

57
00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:51.540
Right now, our top priority is to

58
00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:55.070
take down the Dark Triad 
as quickly as possible.

59
00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:59.570
Even if he can't use Devil Union right 
now, his anti-magic should prove useful.

60
00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:04.950
Right now, the worst situation is...

61
00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:21.240
It appears your magic is 
able to change its properties

62
00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:23.930
to match your opponent's magic.

63
00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:29.180
But now my body magic seems 
to have outperformed even that.

64
00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:33.170
Lasting as long as you 
did was quite a feat.

65
00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:34.940
But you're at your limit.

66
00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:37.070
Shut your damn mouth.

67
00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:40.190
I'm... going to slice you!

68
00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:43.690
Let me thank you for entertaining me.

69
00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:46.200
I'll end you in the most spectacular way.

70
00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:52.870
Exploding Fireball!

71
00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:14.770
Heya, chief.

72
00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:16.610
Huh?

73
00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.270
Who are these two?

74
00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:23.140
They're utter peons.

75
00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:27.200
This is no place for 
nobodies like yourselves.

76
00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:30.580
They're... Yami's peasants?

77
00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:34.330
What the hell are you two 
doing here? Get outta here!

78
00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:38.510
Precisely. There's nothing 
you two could possibly d—

79
00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:41.420
We've come to kick your 
asses and save Captain Yami.

80
00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.150
There are those who still 
manage to entertain me

81
00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:46.470
even if they possess 
less mana than me.

82
00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:49.900
Just like him there. But...

83
00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:52.220
your mana is far too low.

84
00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:53.920
As far as I can tell,

85
00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:58.360
you also don't possess anti-magic 
or any unique arcane stage magic.

86
00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:01.070
Even if you both came at me 
at once, there'd be no—

87
00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:01.610
Don't get the wrong idea.

88
00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:05.320
I'm gonna take you down all by myself.

89
00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:16.830
I think you've mocked me quite enough!

90
00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:19.350
Yeah, I know.

91
00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:23.590
I'm saying that wasting my time with 
you two wouldn't even be a fight!

92
00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:28.450
I get that you're hella strong!

93
00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:33.560
Captain Yami!

94
00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:36.500
That spell's not complete yet!

95
00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:39.100
If you go out there right now, 
you won't be any help.

96
00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:41.860
You'll either die or just get in the way!

97
00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:56.670
And I also know... that I'm weak.

98
00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:01.980
But...

99
00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:06.210
I can't just go back to those 
guys like it doesn't bother me!

100
00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:13.180
I have absolutely no intention of using 
my magic against garbage like you.

101
00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.970
Attack me all you want.

102
00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:17.790
And once you're satisfied...

103
00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:19.510
Leave!

104
00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:21.610
Is that so?

105
00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:24.110
Don't mind if I do, then!

106
00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:28.450
What are you—

107
00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:30.710
And?

108
00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:32.120
So?

109
00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:41.120
A chain?

110
00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.340
What is this?

111
00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:56.840
What?! I'm no longer at 100%?!

112
00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:59.020
Wait, this is just half?

113
00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:01.430
That's completely insane.

114
00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:04.770
There's no way a peasant like me 
could ever muster up magic like this.

115
00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:08.190
That's why I came up with this spell!

116
00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.530
Secret Flame Magic...

117
00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:16.240
Soul Chain Death Match!

118
00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:19.750
I didn't even feel his 
first attack, but now...

119
00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:26.000
I took your magic and my 
magic and split it up evenly.

120
00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:31.050
This is the way I figured out 
to fight you ultimate bastards!

121
00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:34.720
It doesn't matter if I'm a peasant or not!

122
00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:39.180
I, Magna Swing of the Black Bulls...

123
00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:42.020
am gonna kick your ass!

124
00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:48.150
Please! Teach me to fight like you!

125
00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:51.660
My mana was so low 
in the Heart Kingdom

126
00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:52.420
Six months ago

127
00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:54.410
that I was told I wouldn't be able 
to fight using the Mana Method!

128
00:09:54.950 --> 00:10:00.160
But from what I saw, it seemed like you 
could, even if you're a peasant like me.

129
00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:03.490
The one that doubles stuff and knocks 
it back is especially awesome!

130
00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:05.790
Your magic is low, 
but you can still fight!

131
00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:07.140
Please!

132
00:10:07.140 --> 00:10:09.630
That bastard Luck is just 
gonna keep getting stronger!

133
00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:13.630
I can't let him pull ahead 
of me! Anyone but him!

134
00:10:14.850 --> 00:10:19.660
Besides... I can't afford 
to hold the Black Bulls back!

135
00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:25.600
A peasant with flame magic 
who's a Magic Knight, huh?

136
00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:30.360
I don't wanna see you grovel. 
I'll teach you, so just stop already.

137
00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:31.630
Seriously?!

138
00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.470
Follow me.

139
00:10:34.470 --> 00:10:35.380
Sure!

140
00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:39.290
We may have a better shot at discovering 
something if there are two of us.

141
00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:49.380
What's this place?

142
00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:53.300
Welcome to my secret base.

143
00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:58.220
I've been searching for my 
ultimate self forever now, too.

144
00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:03.850
As you figured out, I do use 
that Mana Method thing,

145
00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:05.620
but from what I heard,

146
00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:08.420
in the Heart Kingdom, they put 
together the Mana Method on the spot

147
00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:10.490
and make it part of the fight they're in.

148
00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:15.990
To use that style, you need a ton of 
magic, good instincts, and quick reflexes.

149
00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.950
And as a peasant, 
I don't have any of that,

150
00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:22.430
so I gotta take my time 
putting the arrays together.

151
00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:26.220
That's even more true for powerful 
ones like that counter-trap spell.

152
00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:29.330
We peasants have our 
own advantage, though.

153
00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:36.090
Runes created with our puny mana 
are so puny that they just stick around.

154
00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:39.100
So that means we can take lots of time

155
00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:42.100
and build super-complicated 
arrays in advance.

156
00:11:42.730 --> 00:11:47.790
But to do that, we have to 
know more about mana and us.

157
00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:52.770
What we need is studying 
and slow, boring hard work.

158
00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:58.660
You're clearly stupid and 
short-tempered. Think you can do it?

159
00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:04.250
I've always used my magic without 
thinking too much about it.

160
00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:07.330
But the more I learn about 
mana, the deeper it is!

161
00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:11.010
I gotta consider what works 
best with my attribute...

162
00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:13.650
I don't think I can do the 
double-it-and-kick-back thing.

163
00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:17.890
How do I win against a guy 
with an insane amount of magic?

164
00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:24.100
If only I had a stupid amount 
of magic, I'd win on sheer grit!

165
00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.990
Hey, Big Bro Zora!

166
00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:29.200
Who are you calling "Big Bro"?

167
00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:31.590
How about this array?!

168
00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:38.820
This never even occurred to me, 
but maybe it's not impossible.

169
00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:40.590
Well, that looks interesting.

170
00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:46.580
Though it'll probably need a hell of 
a lot of time and patience to make.

171
00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:02.780
I spent six months making this 
spell that only I could make.

172
00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:05.850
A spell that's mine alone 
and I can only use once.

173
00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:10.690
And that's Secret Flame Magic: 
Soul Chain Death Match!

174
00:13:10.940 --> 00:13:13.770
Hey, it's not that complicated, is it?

175
00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:19.280
I just linked us up and 
split our magic in half.

176
00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:21.580
Lemme just give you one warning.

177
00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:25.780
That chain is our souls.

178
00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:28.290
If you forcefully yank 
it out or destroy it,

179
00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:31.290
you'll go insane, so you better watch it.

180
00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:35.800
No way... A peasant pulled 
off a spell like that?

181
00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:38.300
He sure did.

182
00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:42.150
Any outside attacks can mess with 
the effectiveness of that spell,

183
00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:44.550
so just sit back and watch.

184
00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:47.810
This is now... his fight.

185
00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:55.900
Gravity Magic: Heavy Infighting!

186
00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:04.190
I thought you said I could 
attack all I wanted...

187
00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:05.870
Eh, chief?

188
00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:08.990
Shut up! You filthy little thief!

189
00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:13.500
Gravity Magic: Presence of the Demon King!

190
00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:20.920
We have the same amount of magic. 
I can take whatever you dish out!

191
00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:32.930
No matter...

192
00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.770
what you do...

193
00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:41.260
As long as I regenerate 
with my body magic...

194
00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:46.780
you'll never manage to defeat me!

195
00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:49.390
Get down on your knees

196
00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:53.830
and regret the fact that 
you got ahead of yourself

197
00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:56.150
and defied me!

198
00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:00.190
Even if you got knocked 
down on your knees,

199
00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:03.130
you struggled and continued to fight.

200
00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:06.890
You kept the smoldering fire burning 
and kept preparing right up till today.

201
00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:10.390
It doesn't matter if he's the enemy boss,

202
00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:12.720
a devil host,

203
00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:14.270
or immortal.

204
00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:16.770
Win this...

205
00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:20.230
Magna!

206
00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.280
This magic is...

207
00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:34.600
How dare you...

208
00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:39.880
punch my face and put 
my back on the ground?!

209
00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:04.400
You stole half my magic with 
your underhanded little spell.

210
00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:07.530
Even if we both attack with 
the same amount of strength,

211
00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:12.450
you'll continue taking damage 
while I continue to regenerate!

212
00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:16.200
In the end, our original 
specs were too different!

213
00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.460
You are not the one!

214
00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:24.540
A grotesque little creature like you 
could never bring me supreme bliss!

215
00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:28.970
Yeah, that's right.

216
00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:32.520
I'm just some peasant.

217
00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:36.890
I wasn't born awesome 
like a noble or a royal.

218
00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:42.150
I'm not Luck, who has insane instincts 
even if he was born a commoner,

219
00:16:42.150 --> 00:16:45.620
nor am I Asta, who has something 
insane like anti-magic

220
00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:47.150
even if he's also a peasant.

221
00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:51.690
I just...

222
00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:55.290
Did you have fun in the Heart Kingdom?

223
00:16:56.510 --> 00:17:01.300
Yup. Um, Mister Yami, why did you...

224
00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:02.040
Huh?

225
00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:06.030
Why did you let me join your squad?

226
00:17:06.030 --> 00:17:07.210
Huh?

227
00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:11.330
Maybe because I thought 
we'd have similar interests.

228
00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:14.150
I see...

229
00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:15.970
Also...

230
00:17:18.820 --> 00:17:21.960
You looked like you had more 
guts than anyone out there.

231
00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.570
I...

232
00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:31.790
I...

233
00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:36.660
I'll never lose when 
it comes down to guts!

234
00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:05.550
I busted my brain coming up

235
00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:08.190
with this magic strategy and 
trained like hell for it!

236
00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.860
And I ain't gonna let you...

237
00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:15.860
complain about it, jackass!

238
00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:58.950
I'm gonna blast you into 
smithereens, you dumbass!

239
00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.460
Good work.

240
00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:10.720
Do you understand now?

241
00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:14.890
This is the unfair and 
unequal reality we're in!

242
00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:18.270
No matter how much an inferior 
like you struggles...

243
00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:20.050
It's all...

244
00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:22.680
pointless!

245
00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:29.940
What?!

246
00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:33.270
My devil powers completely disappeared?!

247
00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:35.650
No, this is...

248
00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:39.010
What the hell did you do now?!

249
00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:44.210
I didn't do shit, jackass.

250
00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:47.420
You and I are just 
out of mana, that's all.

251
00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:55.250
I bet a monster like you never 
ran out of mana before...

252
00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:59.070
And you've never fought 
someone as strong as you,

253
00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:04.140
so you'd never realize that you used 
up a shit-ton of magic, would ya?!

254
00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:09.900
I've been depleted of my magic, so I lost 
my connection with Lucifero, as well.

255
00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:14.650
My gravity magic... and my 
super-regenerative body magic, too?!

256
00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:17.900
Now you can't use any spells worth a shit!

257
00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:21.530
Well, the same goes for you—

258
00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:36.510
There's no way I can lose!

259
00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:40.180
I can't possibly... lose 
to someone like you...

260
00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:43.930
A nobody like you!

261
00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:49.140
Pulverize him!

262
00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:03.300
There's no way I could 
lose to a nobody like...

263
00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:04.530
Shut the hell up!

264
00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:07.700
You damn psycho!

265
00:22:07.230 --> 00:22:09.990
Looks like you won, Magna.

266
00:22:11.150 --> 00:22:13.940
Thanks, Big Bro Zora!

267
00:22:14.280 --> 00:22:16.230
Seriously, who are you calling "Big Bro"?

